repository-code: "https://github.com/SamuraiWriter7/consciousness-circle-metadata-specification-v0.1"
abstract: >-
  Consciousness Circle Metadata Specification v0.1.0 defines a metadata layer
  for annotating the question, friction, surface facts, deep context, relational
  dynamics, trace governance, and allocation-readiness of content items in
  AI-mediated knowledge ecosystems. It is designed to support richer retrieval,
  semantic traceability, creator-controlled deep metadata, and future Trace
  Protocol / Royalty OS workflows while preserving privacy, consent, and human
  review.
keywords:
